    "title": "MICROSERVICE-driftdoc-Create Hotel Rooms Hold-v1-spec",
    "description": "The Hotel Room Hold API enables businesses to temporarily reserve hotel rooms for guests, ensuring that preferred accommodations are available for selected dates. This endpoint allows users to create holds on multiple room types based on user preferences and availability. Typically utilized by hotel management systems and booking platforms, this API facilitates streamlined reservation processes, reducing the chances of overbooking. By leveraging this API, providers can enhance the customer experience by securing accommodations before finalizing bookings.",
